            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nkakaguza isenkati omutima, nukwo kujunaana abantu ab'ekitiinisa n'abanyoro, nkabagambira nti: “Nimusaba amagoba, buli omu naagasaba mugenzi we” Nkabasorooleza ekitebe kikooto eky'abantu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabagambira nti: “Tukakora kyona eki twasoboire, tumazire akasumi nitucungura Abayuda bagenzi baitu abakaba baguziibwe omu mahanga; baitu inywe nimuguza bagenzi banyu, kandi nukwo baguzibwe itwe!” Bakagwibwamu akahuno, baaburwa n'eky'okugarukamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabagambira nti: “Eki murukukora, tikirukuhika. Tikibahikiriire kutiina Ruhanga waitu nukwo amaleho emigayo ey'amahanga agaatunobere? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekindi, nyowe, bagenzi bange n'abaheereza bange, tubohoze sente n'engano. Amagoba tugaleke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiro kinu, mubagarurre emisiri yabo, engonjo zaabo ez'emizabbibbu, engonjo zaabo ez'emizaituuni, amaju gaabo, n'ekicweka eky'ekikumi ekya sente, engano, eviini, n'amagita ebi mubaire nimubatonga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nubwo baagambire bati: “Ebi byona nitwija kubigarra, kandi titwagire eki turaabasaba. Kyona eki ogambire nitwija kukikora.” Nkeeta banyakatagara nabarahiza, bahikirize eki baaraganiize. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakunkumura omunagiro gwange ningamba nti: “Weena ataahikirize kinu, Ruhanga amubinge omunju ye na ha mulimo gwe. Nukwo abingwe ati kandi aihweho buli kantu koona.” Ekitebe kyona kyagambira hamu ngu: “Ego” kyahaisaniza MUKAMA. Abantu boona bakakora nkooku baaraganiize.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi okurugirra ha kasumi akanakomiirweho okuba mulemi wabo omukuru omunsi ya Yuda, okurugirra omu mwaka ogw'amakumi abiri okuhika omu gw'amakumi abiri n'esatu ogw'okulema kw'Aruta-gizakisesi omukama, emyaka ikumi n'ebiri, nyowe rundi mugenzi wange, hatabeho ayaliire ha byokulya by'omulemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abalemi abaabandize abaaleetiire abantu obulemeezi, baabaihahoga ebyokulya n'eviini, otabaliireho ebicweka amakumi ana eby'efeeza. Abaheereza baabo nabo baayehulirrahoga abantu. Baitu nyowe eki tinakikoraga, habw'okutiina Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi nkagumira ha mulimo ogw'okwombeka ekisiika kinu, kandi ntatunge nsi noobwakuba emu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ha meeza yange, haalyahoga abasaija kikumi mu ataano, Abayuda, kandi abalemi, otataireho abo abaatwiziremu nibaruga omu mahanga agakaba gatuheriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enimi emu, n'entaama enungi mukaaga, nizo bancumbiraga kiro kimu; enkoko nazo itabuzireho, Kandi buli biro ikumi, endyanga ikumi ez'eviini; noobwakubaire hakaba haroho ebi byona, ntasabe mulemi sente ez'ebyokulya; habwokuba abantu bakaba baina bingi ebirukubalemeera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai Ruhanga, oijuke ebi nakoliire abantu banu habw'embabazi zange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.5.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
